  "  $$LTGREEN$$MOTD;$$FG$$             message of the day\n";
  "  $$LTGREEN$$Oracle;$$FG$$           parlor-game verse\n";
  "  $$LTGREEN$$Caduceus;$$FG$$         the messenger staff\n";
